        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mizengo ya kūpīlīla",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA Mulungu wako ūlū ūmala kūgakenaagūla a mahanga ga banhū abo sī yabo alīkwinha bebe, hūna ū bebe ūlū ūbapeeja a banhū benabo wigasha ū mu mizengo yabo nī numba jabo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īkūkwigeleelwa kūsola mizengo idatū; ībize ha gatī gatī ya sī īyo SEEBA Mulungu wako alīkwinha kwīdima ībize yako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ūkūbeeja nzīla ja kūja ū kū mizengo yenīyo; hūna ī sī īyo SEEBA Mulungu wako alīkwinha kūbiza wingīji wako ūkwīgabanhya hadatū, ībize gīkī ūyo ūbūlaga munhū adūle kūpeelela ko akapīle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shilagīlo īsho shing'wigeleelilwe ūyo ūbūlaga munhū hūna ūpeelela kwenūko kūlwa kūpīja būpanga bokwe, shiishi: Ū wa kūmūlaga nzenganwa ng'wiye mu kūhūbīla, ūbiza walī atang'wikanilwe nūūlū kūng'wibandīīla, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gīt'ūmo munhū adūgije kūja kwipoolu na ng'wiye kūtema mitī; hūna wa kūhayūhubenga ī mbasa, yūfubbūka ū mu mpīni yūntūla ū ng'wiye ūcha! Ū munhū ng'wenūyo adūgije ū kūpeelela kū nzengo gūmò gwa yenīyo ūūkapīlīla kwenūko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ūlū ītī chene, maji wa shiilī adūgije kūnkūūbīja; na lūūlū īkī ū kwipandī lya kūpīlīla halī kūle, ashikile kūmpandīkīla mu nzīla ūntūla ūmūlaga kūlwa būpelanu, alīyo hamo atigeleelilwe kūbūlagwa, nguno ū wei wamūlagaga ū ng'wiye kūlwa kūhūbīla, walī atang'wikanilwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ī nguno yene nalīkūlagīla ūkomanye mizengo idatū kūlwa nguno yako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA Mulungu wako ūlū alajigalīhyī ī mbīmbī jako gīt'ūmo wabisagīgīja mu kwilahīla a bakūlūgenji bako, hūna ūkwinha ī sī ī yose īyo wabisagīja, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īkī ūshidimile ī shilagīlo shose īshi nalīkwinha lelo; kūntogwa ū SEEBA Mulungu wako na kūshimīzīla mu nzīla jakwe shikū jose, ūlū yūja gīko ūkūsola mizengo yīngī idatū hangī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ītaga gīko, gatizidīka mininga gatī na būbi ū mu sī yako īyo SEEBA Mulungu wako alīkwinha kūbiza ya wingīji wako. Ītaga gīko ūtizūgwa mu būhūbi wa kwita mininga gatī na būbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūlū munhū ankolilwe ng'wiye, hūna ūng'wibandīīla hanhū wiza ūntūla ūmūlaga, hanuma ya henaho ūpeela kūja kū nzengo gūmò gwayo ī mizengo yenīyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a banamhala ba mu nzengo gwakwe bakūtūma ajīlwe ū kū nzengo gwenūyo wize atūūlwe mu makono ga maji wa shiilī abūlagwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya ū kū nchīla shigongo ū wa gīko; īng'wigeleelilwe muwīnje ū būbi wa kwita mininga gatī na shilingo ū mu Isilaeli, īmujīle chiza ī mihayo ying'we.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shilagīlo kūlwa mbīmbī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya ū kūlyīnja ī liwe lya ha lūbīmbī lwa kūkūlekanya na nzenganwa ng'wiyo, īlo lītūūlilwe na bataale bako, ū mu wingīji ūbo ūlanukūle ū mu sī īyo SEEBA Mulungu wako alīkwinha ībize yako.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Īyo ībigeleelilwe bakaanīji",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū būkaanīji bo munhū ūmò dūhū, būtigeleelilwe ū kūng'wenheleja munhū kūbalīlwa būhūbi kūlwa mhayo gwabūbi nūūlū būkenaagūji ūbo alībūūlwa gīkī owītile. Ū būng'hana bo mhayo shiigelile būmanwe mu nzīla ya būsombooji wa bakaanīji babīlī nūūlū badatū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū munhū wīmīīla kūmūūla ng'wiye hūna wandya kūtūmamīla būlomolomo ū mu kūnkaanīla, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a banhū benabo būbīlī wabo īkūbigeleelwa kwīmīīla kūlī SEEBA, kū būtongi wa bagabīji na balamuji abo balī h'isumbī ū mu shikū jenījo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A balamuji bakūgīsīlīja chiza ūmo īlī ī mihayo yenīyo, ū nkaanīji ng'wenūyo ūlū ūbonwa nomolomo, yūmanīka hape gīkī alīnkaanīla būlomolomo ū ng'wiye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a henaho mukūng'wītīla gīt'ūmo walī atogilwe wītīlwe ū ng'wiye; īkūng'wigeleelwa muwīnje gete ū būbi ū mu bing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu gīko a banhū bakwigwa ī yenīyī bogohe; na lūūlū ū mhayo gwa malofu gītī gwenūyo gūtīko kūshokeelwa hangī ū mu bing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya ū kwīta shigongo; ū būpanga būlīpwe na būpanga, nī liso kūlwa liso, nī lino kūlwa lino, nū nkono kūlwa nkono, pyī nū kūgūlū kūlwa kūgūlū.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
